## How this folder grows

A Product Delta with target `02-business/*` is proposed at:
- BA Publish stage (per `docs/04-project/harness/engineering/ba-workflow.md`)
- Concept Publish stage (per `docs/04-project/harness/concepts/index.md`)
- Feature close stage when a business rule changed

Implementation detail (class names, code organization) stays in 03-technical.
End-user how-to stays in 01-product. Business language with no code lives here.
